  41:     - Objects whose shape appears in two or more components → translate to TOP edge (row 0).
  42:     - Objects whose shape is unique → translate to BOTTOM edge (row H−h).
  43:     - Horizontal position (left column) is preserved; only vertical translation changes.
  44: 
  45:     Key insight: The sorting criterion is shape frequency (rotation-invariant), not area — duplicated shapes go up, unique shapes go down.
